  message: "Generic helper emit_module_attribute_refs landed in analyze/base.py (PR merged as commit 9a3a78ee0) with 11 unit tests at 100% coverage. Exposed as a module-level function (not a TreeSitterAnalyzer method) because the JS/TS analyzer — the biggest consumer — overrides analyze() entirely and would not benefit from a base-class method. Per-language wire-up of the helper into the actual analyzers (JS/TS, Java, Go, Rust, C) tracked as WI-lozug."  # 7996
